<title>USA: SunTrust Banks sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>SunTrust Banks sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Tuesday, according to sole manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SUNTRUST BANKS INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	     COUPON 7.25 PCT    MATURITY 09/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00   PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1	  SPREAD 48.5	  PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS	  YIELD 7.25 PCT     CALLABLE: NO</p>
